stale_records_deleted.description:
Home Assistant still lists {count} Ampio devices or entities that Ampio Designer no longer provides. They were deleted, or moved to another module:

{names}

Select Submit to delete these records. A moved object comes back under its new module after the reload that follows.

confirm.description:
This deletes {count} devices or entities from Home Assistant:

{names}

Automations and dashboards that name them stop working. Nothing changes on the Ampio server.

stale_records_not_served.description:
Home Assistant still lists {count} Ampio devices or entities that the Ampio account of this integration is not served:

{names}

If you deleted them in Ampio Designer, select Submit to delete these records. If the account lost access to them, restore the access in the Ampio app instead, then reload the integration.

confirm.description:
This deletes {count} devices or entities from Home Assistant:

{names}

Automations and dashboards that name them stop working. Nothing changes on the Ampio server.
